      "Zh": "双人铁甲战士，进阶 10。两人都选择树叶药膏，获得添柴。\n第一个问号会出现变形灵林谷，选择变化初始牌，可以得到黑暗之拥与无惧疼痛。\n这颗种子不要求两位玩家按特定先后顺序领取。\n按游戏 0.111.0、全解锁配置收录。",
      "En": "Two Ironclads, Ascension 10. Both players choose Leafy Poultice for Stoke.\nThe first question-mark room contains Morphic Grove. Transform starter cards for Dark Embrace and Feel No Pain.\nThis seed does not require a particular pickup order between the two players.\nListed for game 0.111.0 with full unlocks."
    },
    "Description": {
      "Zh": "最近发现：在这颗种子里，两位铁甲战士在变形灵林谷变化初始牌，可以得到相同的黑暗之拥与无惧疼痛。",
      "En": "A recent discovery: on this seed, both Ironclads can transform starter cards at Morphic Grove into the same Dark Embrace and Feel No Pain."
